OL,3,GNEWSAThe playground murder: Trauma,
OL,4,Aloss and a love that endured
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Diane Watson was stabbed to death
OL,7,Fin the playground of a Glasgow school
OL,8,Fin 1991, her best friend Pauline was
OL,9,Fstanding by her side.
OL,11,FPauline watched as 16-year-old Diane
OL,12,Fcollapsed after the knife attack by
OL,13,Fanother pupil and then helped to carry
OL,14,Fher across the road to the arms of her
OL,15,Fparents who lived in an upstairs flat
OL,16,Fwithin view of the school.
OL,18,FDiane's murder would not only devastate
OL,19,Fher family, her friends and the local
OL,20,Fcommunity, its shockwaves would go on
OL,21,Fto be felt for decades.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
